{
 "id": "python-setup",
 "icon": "🐍",
 "title": {
  "en": "Set up Python",
  "ar": "جهّز Python"
 },
 "summary": {
  "en": "Install Python, use the `>>>` prompt, run your first file, install packages with pip and keep each project in its own virtual environment.",
  "ar": "ثبّت Python، واستخدم موجّه `>>>`، وشغّل ملفك الأول، وثبّت الحزم بـ pip، واجعل لكل مشروع بيئته الافتراضية الخاصة."
 },
 "lessons": [
  {
   "id": "install-python",
   "title": {
    "en": "Install Python",
    "ar": "ثبّت Python"
   },
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "hero",
     "emoji": "🐍",
     "en": "Python is the engine that runs your code",
     "ar": "Python هو المحرّك الذي يشغّل الكود الذي تكتبه"
    },
    {
     "type": "steps",
     "items": [
      {
       "en": "Open `python.org/downloads` in your browser",
       "ar": "افتح `python.org/downloads` في المتصفح"
      },
      {
       "en": "Download the Windows installer",
       "ar": "نزّل المثبِّت (installer) الخاص بـ Windows"
      },
      {
       "en": "Tick \"Add python.exe to PATH\"",
       "ar": "ضع علامة على \"Add python.exe to PATH\""
      },
      {
       "en": "Click \"Install Now\" and wait",
       "ar": "اضغط \"Install Now\" وانتظر"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "compare",
     "left": {
      "title": {
       "en": "Windows",
       "ar": "Windows"
      },
      "tone": "neutral",
      "items": [
       {
        "en": "Installer from python.org",
        "ar": "المثبِّت من python.org"
       },
       {
        "en": "Tick \"Add python.exe to PATH\"",
        "ar": "فعّل \"Add python.exe to PATH\""
       },
       {
        "en": "Check: `python --version` or `py --version`",
        "ar": "للتأكد: `python --version` أو `py --version`"
       }
      ]
     },
     "right": {
      "title": {
       "en": "macOS / Linux",
       "ar": "macOS / Linux"
      },
      "tone": "neutral",
      "items": [
       {
        "en": "macOS: installer from python.org",
        "ar": "macOS: المثبِّت من python.org"
       },
       {
        "en": "Linux: often already installed",
        "ar": "Linux: غالبًا مثبّت مسبقًا"
       },
       {
        "en": "Check: `python3 --version`",
        "ar": "للتأكد: `python3 --version`"
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "chat",
     "messages": [
      {
       "from": "client",
       "text": "python --version",
       "note": {
        "en": "type it in the terminal",
        "ar": "اكتبه في الطرفية (terminal)"
       }
      },
      {
       "from": "server",
       "text": "Python 3.10.11",
       "note": {
        "en": "installed! yours may be newer",
        "ar": "تم التثبيت! قد يكون رقمك أحدث"
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "cards",
     "items": [
      {
       "icon": "🔎",
       "color": "blue",
       "title": {
        "en": "PATH",
        "ar": "الـ PATH"
       },
       "text": {
        "en": "The list of folders Windows searches for commands",
        "ar": "قائمة المجلدات التي يبحث فيها Windows عن الأوامر"
       }
      },
      {
       "icon": "📇",
       "color": "purple",
       "title": {
        "en": "Like phone contacts",
        "ar": "مثل جهات الاتصال في هاتفك"
       },
       "text": {
        "en": "Not on the list? Windows cannot find it",
        "ar": "ليس في القائمة؟ لن يجده Windows"
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "chat",
     "messages": [
      {
       "from": "client",
       "text": "python --version",
       "note": {
        "en": "PATH box was not ticked",
        "ar": "لم تُفعَّل خانة PATH"
       }
      },
      {
       "from": "server",
       "text": "'python' is not recognized as an internal or external command,\noperable program or batch file.",
       "note": {
        "en": "Windows cannot find Python",
        "ar": "Windows لا يجد Python"
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "warn",
     "en": "Fix: uninstall, reinstall with the PATH box ticked, then open a new terminal. Or try `py`.",
     "ar": "الحل: أزِل التثبيت، ثم ثبّت مجددًا مع تفعيل خانة PATH، وافتح طرفية جديدة. أو جرّب `py`."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "editor-and-repl",
   "title": {
    "en": "Your tools and the >>> prompt",
    "ar": "أدواتك وموجّه >>>"
   },
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "hero",
     "emoji": "⌨️",
     "en": "The `>>>` prompt is a super calculator",
     "ar": "موجّه `>>>` آلة حاسبة خارقة"
    },
    {
     "type": "cards",
     "items": [
      {
       "icon": "📝",
       "color": "blue",
       "title": {
        "en": "Code editor",
        "ar": "محرّر الأكواد (code editor)"
       },
       "text": {
        "en": "Where you write files, such as VS Code (free)",
        "ar": "مكان كتابة الملفات، مثل VS Code (مجاني)"
       }
      },
      {
       "icon": "⬛",
       "color": "purple",
       "title": {
        "en": "Terminal",
        "ar": "الطرفية (terminal)"
       },
       "text": {
        "en": "A window for typing commands; Windows: Command Prompt",
        "ar": "نافذة لكتابة الأوامر؛ في Windows: Command Prompt"
       }
      },
      {
       "icon": "🐍",
       "color": "green",
       "title": {
        "en": "Python prompt `>>>`",
        "ar": "موجّه Python `>>>`"
       },
       "text": {
        "en": "Type one line, Python answers at once",
        "ar": "اكتب سطرًا واحدًا، ويجيب Python فورًا"
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "steps",
     "items": [
      {
       "en": "Open the terminal",
       "ar": "افتح الطرفية"
      },
      {
       "en": "Type `python` and press Enter",
       "ar": "اكتب `python` واضغط Enter"
      },
      {
       "en": "See `>>>`: Python is listening",
       "ar": "ترى `>>>`: الـ Python يستمع إليك"
      },
      {
       "en": "Type `exit()` to leave",
       "ar": "اكتب `exit()` للخروج"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "chat",
     "messages": [
      {
       "from": "client",
       "text": ">>> 2 + 3"
      },
      {
       "from": "server",
       "text": "5",
       "note": {
        "en": "instant answer",
        "ar": "إجابة فورية"
       }
      },
      {
       "from": "client",
       "text": ">>> 10 / 4"
      },
      {
       "from": "server",
       "text": "2.5",
       "note": {
        "en": "division gives decimals",
        "ar": "القسمة تعطي كسورًا عشرية"
       }
      },
      {
       "from": "client",
       "text": ">>> 2 ** 10"
      },
      {
       "from": "server",
       "text": "1024",
       "note": {
        "en": "2 to the power 10",
        "ar": "2 أُس 10"
       }
      },
      {
       "from": "client",
       "text": ">>> \"Hi\" * 3"
      },
      {
       "from": "server",
       "text": "'HiHiHi'",
       "note": {
        "en": "text works too!",
        "ar": "النصوص تعمل أيضًا!"
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "pills",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "+",
       "color": "green",
       "label": {
        "en": "add",
        "ar": "جمع"
       }
      },
      {
       "text": "-",
       "color": "red",
       "label": {
        "en": "subtract",
        "ar": "طرح"
       }
      },
      {
       "text": "*",
       "color": "blue",
       "label": {
        "en": "multiply",
        "ar": "ضرب"
       }
      },
      {
       "text": "/",
       "color": "yellow",
       "label": {
        "en": "divide",
        "ar": "قسمة"
       }
      },
      {
       "text": "**",
       "color": "purple",
       "label": {
        "en": "power",
        "ar": "أُس"
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "tip",
     "en": "On macOS/Linux, type `python3` to open the `>>>` prompt.",
     "ar": "على macOS/Linux اكتب `python3` لفتح موجّه `>>>`."
    }
   ]
  },
